WEBVTT

00:17:26.458 --> 00:17:31.254
možemo ga koristiti da pravimo lekove
koji  mogu biti samo za jednu osobu,

00:17:31.296 --> 00:17:33.381
poput personalizovane vakcine za kancer,

00:17:33.423 --> 00:17:38.929
ili za lekove koje možemo ubrzano
da proizvedemo i distribuiramo globalno,

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:41.264
poput kovid-19 vakcine.

00:17:41.306 --> 00:17:43.183
A najbolji deo?

00:17:43.225 --> 00:17:48.230
Najbolji deo je da koristimo
sposobnost vašeg tela

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:50.774
da proizvodi sopstvene lekove.

00:17:50.774 --> 00:17:52.067
Hvala vam.

00:17:52.067 --> 00:17:58.949
(Aplauz)